        "rejected": [
          {
            "candidate": "Telecommunication Provider",
            "gate": "2",
            "reason": "This is a kind_of relationship; the attribution-rewrite test results in 'a different thing' (any provider) rather than the same entity with less detail."
          }
        ],
        "notes": "The jump from 'Matrix Telecom Ltd' to 'Matrix' removes both legal status qualifiers (Ltd, LLC, Ат) and functional descriptors (Telecom). Both are handled by the drop-qualifier move. This ladder provides a path for entities that include extra identifying metadata in their names.",
